 data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Subdomínio genérico&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Generic subdomain&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;472&quot; data-end=&quot;564&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Problema comum a várias empresas, normalmente resolvido por produto ou solução existente&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
