        <mxCell id="fM1tTdFUm4pOwlo0JNWG-53" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p data-start=&quot;1986&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Além disso, “modelo de ML”, “API” ou “pipeline” normalmente não são subdomínios. São soluções técnicas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;O subdomínio seria algo como:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y6d6my&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2148&quot;&gt;determinar o uso do solo;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bdo02i&quot; data-start=&quot;2149&quot; data-end=&quot;2185&quot;&gt;consolidar a situação territorial;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18eehd7&quot; data-start=&quot;2186&quot; data-end=&quot;2220&quot;&gt;detectar mudanças no território;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;noj4d8&quot; data-start=&quot;2221&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;fornecer evidências para decisões de risco.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="460" x="1760" y="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
