        <mxCell id="9io1BMaQ7AhXAmXuntyE-17" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;" value="&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;O motivo principal é que eles possuem objetivos, modelos, regras e ciclos de vida diferentes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;509&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ropbxe&quot; data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;408&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;356&quot;&gt;Uso do Solo&lt;/strong&gt; responde: “Como o território está sendo utilizado?”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xj2x9k&quot; data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;509&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;411&quot; data-end=&quot;441&quot;&gt;Produtividade Agropecuária&lt;/strong&gt; responde: “O que, quando e quanto é produzido nas áreas agrícolas?”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;511&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;Eles se relacionam fortemente, mas relacionamento forte não significa que devam compartilhar o mesmo modelo de domínio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;12g4yxy&quot; data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;Comparação dos modelos&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot;&gt;&lt;table data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot; class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot;&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Aspecto&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;669&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot; data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gestão do Uso do Solo&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;693&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot; data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Produtividade Agropecuária&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody data-start=&quot;738&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;738&quot; data-end=&quot;844&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;738&quot; data-end=&quot;749&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Objetivo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;749&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Consolidar a ocupação e utilização do território&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;800&quot; data-end=&quot;844&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Acompanhar e estimar a produção agrícola&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Unidade central&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Área territorial ou parcela de uso do solo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Área cultivada, talhão ou unidade produtiva&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;956&quot; data-end=&quot;1041&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;956&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Dimensão temporal&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;1015&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Data da observação e vigência do uso&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1041&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ciclo agrícola e safra&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Classificações&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Agricultura, pastagem, vegetação nativa, água, área urbana etc.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Soja, milho, algodão, cultura, plantio e colheita&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Resultado&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Uso do solo consolidado&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Histórico e estimativa produtiva&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1394&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Consumidores&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Crédito, risco, socioambiental, compliance, analytics&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1394&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Crédito agro, planejamento, acompanhamento e previsão de produção&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Regras importantes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1416&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proveniência, conflito entre fontes, validade, cobertura e versionamento&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Safra, cultura, ciclo produtivo, produtividade e produção&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Linguagem principal&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1575&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Uso, cobertura, ocupação, fonte, observação e vigência&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; data-start=&quot;1632&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cultura, safra, plantio, colheita, produtividade e produção&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
